<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93911" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῆψις</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σᾶψις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σήπομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fermentation,
				putrefaction, decay</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐχμηραί τε νόσοι καὶ σήψιες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					121
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑγρῶν σάψιες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ti.Locr.
					102c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				569a28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τέλος τῆς κατὰ φύσιν φθορᾶς ς.
					ἐστιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					379a8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. χλωρή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Prorrh.</u>
					1.99
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ὀστέων</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφάκελος</span>, Moer.<i><span class="en">
				p.342P.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σήπω</span>) <i>the process by which the intestines reject that
				part of food which is not nutritious</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέψις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				762a14
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.276d
			</span></i>, and 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σήπω</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11.4
			</span></i>. (Acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.373
			</span></i> Empedocles said that <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέψις</span>
			took place <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σήψει</span>.)</div>
